        "abstract": "The three main approaches to congestion control are compared, and an implicit congestion avoidance technique based on Kalman filtering is summarised. A four-stage cycle of throughput observation, congestion level prediction, traffic load adjustment decision and window modification is simulated for comparison, and performances are plotted against normalised background traffic intensity.<<ETX xmlns:mml=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\">&gt;</ETX>",
